WEBVTT

00:07:28.795 --> 00:07:31.457
and diabetes in kids and 30-year-olds

00:07:31.481 --> 00:07:33.651
has increased 70 percent
in the last 10 years.

00:07:33.675 --> 00:07:35.198
It's no joke, it's real.

00:07:35.222 --> 00:07:37.800
And just to show you this,
this is from the CDC.

00:07:37.824 --> 00:07:39.304
These are not election returns;

00:07:39.328 --> 00:07:41.854
these are the percentage of people
who are overweight.

00:07:41.878 --> 00:07:48.412
And if you see from '85 to '86
to '87, '88, '89, '90, '91 --

00:07:48.436 --> 00:07:50.797
you get a new category, 15 to 20 percent;

00:07:50.821 --> 00:07:56.942
'92, '93, '94, '95, '96, '97 --
you get a new category;

00:07:56.966 --> 00:08:00.433
'98, '99, 2000 and 2001.